# Project Memory

This file stores project-specific knowledge, conventions, and user preferences learned by the AI assistant.

## User Preferences

- User prefers clean, modern dashboard design with micro-interactions
- Black as primary color and orange as secondary color
- Prefers a combined Home page rather than separate Usage and Plan pages
- Wants to display "Time Saved" and efficiency metrics rather than raw activity
- Simplified navigation with no top header bar
- Pro Plan card should be displayed as a vertical column on the right side of usage stats
- Compact UI with reduced component sizes
- No notification settings in Settings page
- No two-factor authentication option in Account page
- Larger overall window size (140% of normal)
- Reduced spacing between components
- Two stat cards instead of three at the top of dashboard

## Technical Decisions

- Using framer-motion for animations and micro-interactions
- Using Tailwind CSS for styling
- Color scheme based on sonic-dark (black) and sonic-orange themes
- Using SVG for line charts with gradient fill underneath
- Larger overall dashboard size for better visibility

## Project Conventions

- Dashboard components use rounded-xl corners for cards
- Interactive elements have hover/tap animations
- Color tokens: sonic-darker, sonic-dark, sonic-gray, sonic-orange, sonic-light-orange
- Card-based layout with consistent padding/spacing
- Icons use stroke-based design (width: 20px)
- App logo and name placed in sidebar
- Line chart shows efficiency metrics comparing typing vs dictation speed
- Side-by-side layout for main content and plan information
- Matching height between plan card and graph chart
